  ============================================================================
  SYNTHETIC.  NOT EXPERIMENTAL DATA.  EVERY NUMBER BELOW IS INVENTED.
  ============================================================================
  A structural fixture for gui/tests/thermomlReader.test.ts: ONE file, many
  block SHAPES, so the TypeScript reader (gui/src/case/thermomlReader.ts) and
  the Python extractor (bin/choupo-thermoml) are run on the same bytes and
  held to the same records, refusals and written rows.  The compounds are
  "componentA/B/C" with InChIKey-SHAPED placeholders that name no substance;
  the DOI is in the reserved 10.0000 prefix and resolves to nothing.
  Licence: GPL-3.0-or-later, like the rest of Choupo.  No third-party data.
  ============================================================================
-->
